Hello [First Name],

Metro Associates is recruiting engineering and construction professionals for=
 opportunities across New York City and the surrounding metro area.

Current areas of focus include:
=E2=80=A2 MEP, HVAC, electrical, plumbing, Revit and BIM
=E2=80=A2 Civil, structural, transportation and infrastructure
=E2=80=A2 Bridge inspection, construction inspection and DOT-related work
=E2=80=A2 Project managers, construction managers and field professionals
=E2=80=A2 Data-center and mission-critical engineering roles

Positions may be onsite, hybrid or remote depending on the opportunity.

Interested in learning more? Reply with:
=E2=80=A2 Your updated resume
=E2=80=A2 Preferred position or specialty
=E2=80=A2 Current location and acceptable commute
=E2=80=A2 Compensation expectations
=E2=80=A2 Availability to interview and start
=E2=80=A2 Work authorization

